OneNote import uses vive-converter (https://github.com/AquilaIgnis/vive-converter)
and its onenote_parser crate from onenote.rs (https://github.com/msiemens/onenote.rs).

The native converter is built from source. Its unmodified license file accompanies the
library under onenote/licenses/ in the shared JVM jar.

onenote_parser is compiled into the converter library unmodified and is licensed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). Its source code is available at
https://github.com/msiemens/onenote.rs and https://crates.io/crates/onenote_parser.
